MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "PTX, Vol. 1 feels like a natural next choice because Pentatonix's layered vocal harmonies connect with what I enjoy about Straight No Chaser.",
    "Lead With Your Heart also appeals to my interest in vocal groups, although I would only try one album during this visit."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Crash My Party and the Lesley Gore collection do not connect with the vocal harmonies I want to hear right now.",
    "Titles such as ICON and Greatest Hits II give me no clear reason to expect a connection with my recent listening, so I would pass rather than assume they suit me."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The choices seem to treat broad hit collections as a match for my interest in classic Christmas albums, even though familiar songs alone are not what draws me in.",
    "The list seems to assume that interest in a few albums carries over to many other singers, without enough connection to the vocal sound I enjoy."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The vocal harmonies associated with my most recent choice, The New Old Fashioned, matter more to me now than a general collection of popular songs.",
    "My Christmas listening happened together in November, well before my latest interaction, so I would not assume I am still looking mainly for holiday music."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "A couple of choices understood my interest in vocal harmonies, but most offered too little connection to that sound to motivate me to try them."
}
